  3.9719283187207623`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"88717406-a16a-4cb7-96f6-\
f3742ec726dc"],

Cell["\<\
Fits subsets of the FFT\[CloseCurlyQuote]d data centered around the peak to \
see how precision changes with # of FFT points used for the Lorentzian fit.
Uses dataFFTMag (from import & regular process section).
Note: obviously requires \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Import & Regular Process\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] to be run.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.968698197865409*^9, 3.968698290607059*^9}, {
  3.968720658870598*^9, 
  3.968720666626041*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"526a5455-0004-49b7-a29d-\
7227dea80df0"],

